    "summary": "Add governed supply-chain gates to CI. cargo-deny enforces a policy bundle for advisories, licenses, and banned crates across every Rust manifest in the repo; pnpm/npm audit covers the JavaScript surface (product/apps/opc + platform/services/statecraft). Posture is blocking from day 0 (the 30-day warn-only window planned in §9.1 was collapsed on 2026-05-02 after a clean dry-run; see §9 promotion record). The gate is mirrored in the Makefile under a new `ci-supply-chain` target, composed into `make ci`, and validated by ci-parity-check.\n",
